# Trivy allowlist for the ModelMux image.
#
# CI fails on HIGH/CRITICAL vulnerabilities that have a fix available
# (--ignore-unfixed); Debian security updates are applied at build time.
# Unfixed base-image findings are reviewed on each release, not listed here.
#
# Add a CVE below ONLY with a justification and a review date, e.g.:
#   CVE-0000-00000  # <why it does not apply>; review by YYYY-MM-DD
